      "rationale": "Resolves a closed leaf from durable records, never from a worktree. It reads the leaf's recorded enclosure contract first. It then asks the converted-repository resolution: a leaf that recorded a tree comparison reopens from its tree ids, and on a converted official line a leaf that recorded only a dataset comparison keeps its code sides and reports its knowledge sides legacy-unavailable, with no database read. Only an unconverted repository's leaf goes on to its comparison generation, and to the bare source range when none was published; an ambiguous or unreadable generation is refused rather than replaced.",
